  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sounds Right, Museum for the United Nations - UN Live</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to drive a significant improvement in the health of ecosystems in the identified landscapes (incl. in Africa) &#x2013; across both biodiversity, climate and community impact variables &#x2013; by accelerating Denmark&#x2019;s public contribution to conservation and nature financing. The impact variables are (i) increase in hectares (land, ocean, water) protected and improved; and (ii) number of kilometres of rivers and streams protected and improved (deforestation averted), and (iii) number and diversity of species protected and improved - as well as (i) number of community-led activities supported, (ii) number of indigenous and local community members participating in and benefiting from livelihood programs; and (iii) number of land rights secured and enforced.</narrative>
  </description>
